=Please draft a follow-up email to this vendor:

Vendor: {{ $json.vendor_name }}
Project: {{ $json.project_name }}
Invoice number: {{ $json.invoice_number }}
Invoice date: {{ $json.invoice_date }}
Invoice total: ${{ $json.invoice_total }}
Reference {{ $json.ref_label }} total: ${{ $json.ref_label === 'PO' ? $json.po_total : $json.quote_total }}
Variance: ${{ $json.variance_amount }}

Discrepancies found:
{{ $json.flag_summary }}

Draft the email body now.

